{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本文化｜日本是香港人最愛旅遊的國家，對於一些日本特有的文化不會感到陌生，甚至「見怪不怪」，但回憶起來，你又記不記得第一次遊日感受到最大的文化差異是什麼？以下歸納出22個最衝擊港人的日本文化，哪個最令你吃驚？</p><figure><img alt=\"原來日本的選舉活動很擾民？（《逃避很可恥但有用》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396333976207233024438619.jpeg/GMflphZOIGL9G21LdvCXBvTqYIPTDKH8Z-qw3mfqsN4\"/><figcaption>原來日本的選舉活動很擾民？（《逃避很可恥但有用》劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>日本和香港的生活環境不同，而且每個地方都有獨有的文化習慣。在外國人眼中，究竟有甚麼令人驚訝的日本文化？例如吃拉麵時要發出「雪雪」聲原來已經過時？小學生獨自上學好勇敢？其中有些更是令日本人都覺得「放過我吧！」的日常！</p><p>👇👇即按下圖看衝擊港人的22個日本文化👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339064933978112431267.jpeg/shjUL-lEcGihrsajn-Us11rvx8dk7RYGdLv0K3S79Cs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339067924647936074192.jpeg/YTPMAS4qtzTSxqx7_LTBejbdcrb5ChQM1M7_odTO_6E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339070483304448721895.jpeg/mZnl5vblVoa8NnO8xMKQ-O46qLDKAtJcLLB9qiywfao\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339073134235648561378.jpeg/UWiRSvapbntgfxPVjXwA4H_SIVSwgiCoyto1ZcraNWU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339075386707968740961.jpeg/mcinH5AWvZ7BkJYqx_vJl9GdwyAfClhxU9ynm1Pcp5s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339078746476544270653.jpeg/kHJbIBFWq3kBnJR6V1PfDFUNHMZ8rexJDjmb9g45m_Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339081321910272752890.jpeg/x2xlQlfX-DC8BN6CAIdev44pUie5VQ3BuiG7V7ohu1c\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339083784097792706185.jpeg/ODskVwq7RLG8jQzng0HP5aAoJqnbqxB-To26YU6NumE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339086552469504512836.jpeg/V1DLQWpmHHwK_RBT59cQUbTGaI1A4Tt0RmXah0Zl2oc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339088985296896132756.jpeg/q7d_d_Ck_aFxebb6NYxu7WgPDvzZhKTuX4If3l-CH94\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339060567707648405138.jpeg/ucxuXTRaOZ6m-zV3qkdFUWfeWZtHF_PtKd_yUCnf8lA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396339063415771136693584.jpeg/MLdIjNQcnD78t5l5YX-icnmvM3muUG_XqVwtNKlcLTQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341319498207232961302.jpeg/oJl30NNiq6zHPAHkI3Z83-B0C207xd9kMw-NcDMPjXA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341322413379584128365.jpeg/O2mOiOoboA0VrmZcZP5XSoOmIOHzKcryhVz3i4Vc94s\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341325844451328492605.jpeg/eZlMTSjrCnbcZn8cC8KagoWUlk_SyAoQ9F7le_Re5Xs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341328428273664634508.jpeg/y0cWF-pk-dP3KSmrMOJFMRkYyx1r3sk7Hzn1qx859as\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341332274581504275863.jpeg/lUsaOg1izAdNOnnZcT9wUVpbQXSYrBw-S9bmT0vW5k8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341335273639936403925.jpeg/QIHd5C304LVOReN4WE3YDk3puulqb_361C-oLdQvqC0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341338977341440678491.jpeg/hVU8d5g62tS2ZoOgfggUsQusSLD5uxivvLSFq7y0has\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341341812822016314072.jpeg/RH18Zo1kTvz5EqGEngqeSoReBicOZQ3GEhvsaBIb7Gg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341344673468416695148.jpeg/h71Q4aPDtFcCLOasrzT2b3cWgw1GGy5PHbsbVh27G1Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341347731247104619473.jpeg/MHIDcOtKzEdRf45Cb_X5ikhamWIbar02vDHAfbwxwH0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341315400372224107853.jpeg/rm0KRbyQ8728qFO7Fmunh-wz4-z0HmQLb63xI2-t8SM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201023/396341318336516096274869.jpeg/6Ho1qH0VvBriFQFMtMtTdKq_cljJKeOEo8nx8qPJ8fI\"/><p>Click 入專頁睇更多日本旅遊推介！👉👉👉 日本旅遊天書　住宿　美食　景點　購物　不停更新！</p><p>同場加映：東京迪士尼樂園13個秘密</p><p>日本節目《教えてもらう前と後》早前在東京迪士尼樂園訪問了100位「迪士尼迷」，收集只有資深Fans才知道的小秘密，其中有很多都是隱藏在魔鬼細節之中，讓人不禁感嘆：「無論去多少次都能有新的發現！」👇👇👇按下圖揭開「夢之國」的秘密👇👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892556556570624806759.jpeg/3U8By40vn1-mdIWq3bGKfF3S6H6dEA_9Z3sJ0Wd7CdE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892561321562112685974.jpeg/M1YXwhjXPvc1QBI6dHWfT5lwhh3PG2pQmR84TpkfOE4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892564786188288350642.jpeg/4Rjsml13zs2Ywf_yrEV0cqwjfNB8_DV487Gx7vOxse4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892567579725824615438.jpeg/jaSpx-ifGYAoLEgjPcjZvpXb_Pz-wklxmUR_j5lEf48\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892570310348800358914.jpeg/AL5yYpYsNrdsV8XYnWSjOzUeoKtugDqkVW2abFVtmmw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892572755759104879165.jpeg/h-VJxvp_E2ZOaMKUOhH1VY7UrQk__93hHim5iB4puYg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892575591239680432860.jpeg/USQjjowmjhPK35OR-8a_e2fg9BpwPgCwpwuIUKcLiFA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892577986318336804962.jpeg/x2zsExhw4xNquqMKljlyD9aKiS9X9D7tjazAKY2swCk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201019/394892580528197632872459.jpeg/kS1Z19W29Vbz7Q41Yg1TTw1lMYbxDn5_9bqBlfW6gZU\"/><p>還有東京迪士尼限定的可愛角色！即看全文：東京迪士尼樂園13個秘密　灰姑娘城堡不是最高？限定角色哪裡找？</p><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T02:58:56.020215+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":529,"images":34,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}